D%20product%20shots0-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69289524195a1f9e06ade49b/6a1ef859476be41a3fbca5c2_RNGD%20product%20shots0-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69289524195a1f9e06ade49b/6a1ef859476be41a3fbca5c2_RNGD%20product%20shots0-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69289524195a1f9e06ade49b/6a1ef859476be41a3fbca5c2_RNGD%20product%20shots0-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69289524195a1f9e06ade49b/6a1ef859476be41a3fbca5c2_RNGD%20product%20shots0.avif 1920w" class="inline-video_poster"/><video muted="" loop="" playsinline="true" preload="none" data-video-desktop-only="false" data-video-scroll-in-play="true" data-video-hover="false" data-video="video" class="inline-video_video w-variant-b896ebdf-95da-54ca-945a-30b4839403ab video"><source data-src="https://static.furiosa.info/Videos/RNGD%20product%20shots.mp4" type="video/mp4" class="source"/></video></div><div data-wf--background-fade--variant="uniform" class="background-fade w-variant-078662c9-93f5-c3fc-3d72-386b7135bb3f"></div><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container u-z-index-1 w-container"><div data-wf--grid-row--settings-column-alignment="top-center" id="" STYLE="" class="row-component"><div class="row w-variant-478364d0-b9a1-9a8d-3561-fc2372ac7598"><div data-wf--grid-column--settings-column-size="12-12" id="" STYLE="" class="col w-variant-c2470e99-215a-e78c-3ec0-c579f938e15e"><div class="slot cc-column"><div id="" STYLE="" class="div h4 u-text-center fade-in-1 u-text-weight-400"><div>&quot;For the launch of our new Seoul office, we showcased our gpt-oss 120B model running live on Furiosa’s flagship RNGD accelerator marking the first time our models have run on Korean silicon.<br/><br/>This was a huge milestone, showing what’s possible when world-class AI meets world-class hardware innovation.&quot;</div></div><div data-wf--spacer--settings-size="xx-large---48px" ID="" STYLE="" class="spacer-component w-variant-580b9148-d24d-1167-38b4-03e773de2f8a"></div><div data-wf--image--settings-aspect-ratio="23x8" id="" STYLE="max-width: 10.25rem;" class="img-component w-variant-06b71f63-85ef-949f-88c9-98f13e14e79b u-mlr-auto fade-in-1"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69289524195a1f9e06ade49b/6a188a3f669dd17c0800eb77_OpenAI%20logo.svg" loading="lazy" data-wf--image-fit--image-fit="contain---center" fetchpriority="" alt="Logo of OpenAI" object-fit="Object Fit" class="u-img-cover w-variant-6e0dbd54-fb26-1f81-ced3-991ab8d4bea6"/><div class="img-component_bg-overlay"></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--settings-size="xx-small-6px" ID="" STYLE="" class="spacer-component w-variant-42769099-f1ba-871b-f260-3ba748997ce5"></div><div id="" STYLE="" class="div paragraph-lg u-text-center u-text-weight-400 fade-in-1"><div>Danial Mirza, Applied AI</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section cc-dark cc-md-padding"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div data-wf--grid-row--settings-column-alignment="top-left" id="" STYLE="" class="row-component"><div class="row"><div data-wf--grid-column--settings-column-size="10-12" id="" STYLE="" class="col w-variant-95c67bf8-407f-143d-c1b2-46906c26a2f4"><div class="slot cc-column"><div data-wf--heading--settings-alignment="left-align" id="" STYLE="" class="heading-component"><h2 class="h1 text-stagger u-text-uppercase">Proven in Production</h2></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--settings-size="x-huge---144px" ID="" STYLE="" class="spacer-component w-variant-c84ab352-add8-7a11-d3a4-a606faafb117"></div><div id="" STYLE="" class="div paragraph-xxl u-text-weight-400 fade-in-1"><div>Output throughput (tokens/s)</div></div><div data-wf--spacer--settings-size="medium---24px" ID="" STYLE="" class="spacer-component"></div><div data-wf--grid-row--settings-column-alignment="top-center" id="" STYLE="" class="row-component"><div class="row w-variant-478364d0-b9a1-9a8d-3561-fc2372ac7598"><div data-wf--grid-column--s