eering implementation of the high-performance AI accelerator." sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" data-wf--image-fit--image-fit="contain---center" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69289524195a1f9e06ade49b/6a18ab7e01bbf3759ee6f768_RNGD%20stacked-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69289524195a1f9e06ade49b/6a18ab7e01bbf3759ee6f768_RNGD%20stacked-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69289524195a1f9e06ade49b/6a18ab7e01bbf3759ee6f768_RNGD%20stacked-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69289524195a1f9e06ade49b/6a18ab7e01bbf3759ee6f768_RNGD%20stacked-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69289524195a1f9e06ade49b/6a18ab7e01bbf3759ee6f768_RNGD%20stacked.avif 1616w"/><div class="img-component_bg-overlay"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--settings-size="xxx-large---72px" ID="" STYLE="" class="spacer-component w-variant-ef8b27f4-3830-f2fc-fbb6-22bb2adb950c"></div><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div data-wf--grid-row--settings-column-alignment="top-center" id="" STYLE="" class="row-component"><div class="row w-variant-478364d0-b9a1-9a8d-3561-fc2372ac7598"><div data-wf--grid-column--settings-column-size="8-12" id="" STYLE="" class="col w-variant-c40c2b54-bd7f-c6df-c4ad-1c9f757a89d2"><div class="slot cc-column"><div id="" STYLE="" class="div paragraph-xxl u-text-weight-500 u-text-silver fade-in-1"><div>RNGD (pronounced “renegade”) delivers high-performance LLM and multimodal deployment capabilities while maintaining a radically efficient 180W power profile.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--settings-size="huge---96px" ID="" STYLE="" class="spacer-component w-variant-27a725ed-9bea-4849-b7b0-5a97d2515c03"></div><div class="fade-in-1"><div data-wf--grid-row--settings-column-alignment="top-center" id="" STYLE="" class="row-component"><div class="row w-variant-478364d0-b9a1-9a8d-3561-fc2372ac7598"